{title: Communion Song}
{artist: Melinda Fletcher}
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}

Take eat this is my body given for you 
He said, Take drink this is my blood I offered for you 
And as we eat remember Him 
His body broken so we'd be made whole 
And as we drink we think on him 
His blood poured out so that we'd be white as snow 
No more sin no more guilt washed away 

He took our curse so that we'd be blessed 
It's all in Him our righteousness 
It's all by grace And It's all for love
His life laid down in one great exchange 
 
He is the lord of all 
He is the son of God 
And He’s the only way to the Father's arms 
With all our hearts we sing 
All praises to our King 
Jesus' life in place of ours in one great exchange
